## Architecture

```
src/
├── main.ts                  ← starts the gateway
├── server.ts                ← builds the Hapi gateway, initializes all services
├── config/env.ts
├── plugins/                  ← shared Hapi plugins (swagger, auth)
├── errors/                   ← AppError base class
├── shared/                   ← shared database/cache clients
└── services/<name>/          ← one directory per microservice
    ├── <name>.service.ts     ← service init function → { routes }
    ├── dto/                   ← request validation (Joi/Zod)
    └── persistence/           ← entity + repository (ORM-specific)
```

Each service is isolated — it exports an async `init<Name>Service()` function
that the gateway calls. Services do not import from each other.

