## Key Hapi Patterns

- Services export `initXService() → Promise<{ routes: ServerRoute[] }>` factories
- Gateway calls each service and mounts `service.routes` via `server.route()`
- Plugins (swagger, auth) registered once in `server.ts`
- Error handling: `onPreResponse` ext catches all errors
- No middleware — use `server.ext()` lifecycle hooks and plugins instead

